#: docs/sap/methods.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart TB\n"
"  subgraph satellite [Satellite]\n"
"    Client[SapClient.request]\n"
"  end\n"
"  subgraph hub [Hub ws-server]\n"
"    Router[SAP_METHODS router]\n"
