"  Router -->|res| Client\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/methods.md:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Session"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:44
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Method                    | Schema                                                               | Hub behavior                                                                                                |\n"
"| ------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `conversation.create`     | [`session.ts`](../../src/shared/sap-contract/frames/conversation.ts) | Creates session; sets `platform_extra.satellite_app_id`, `satellite_instance_id`, optional workspace fields |\n"
"| `conversation.list`       | `session.ts`                                                         | Lists conversations, optional `platform` filter                                                             |\n"
"| `conversation.messages`   | `session.ts`                                                         | Message history with `offset` / `limit`                                                                     |\n"
"| `conversation.patchTitle` | `session.ts`                                                         | Updates conversation title                                                                                  |\n"
"| `conversation.subscribe`  | `session.ts`                                                         | Subscribes to `conversation.updated` events for one conversation                                            |\n"
"| `conversation.commands`   | `session.ts`                                                         | Lists slash commands for a platform                                                                         |\n"
"| `conversation.acpDock`    | [`acp.ts`](../../src/shared/sap-contract/frames/acp.ts)              | ACP dock operations for a conversation                                                                      |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/methods.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "`conversation.create` platform binding"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:48
msgid ""
"Hub resolves `platform` from input or `formatSapPlatform(app_id, "
"instance_id)` → `sap:{app_slug}:{instance_id}` (e.g. "
"`sap:pairprogramming:k7m`). Writes into conversation `platform_extra`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/methods.md:52
msgid "`satellite_app_id` — normalized app slug"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/methods.md:52
msgid "`satellite_instance_id` — instance id from connect context"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/methods.md:52
msgid ""
"Optional: `workspace_root`, `workspace_gitignore`, `workspace_show_hidden`, "
"`capability_mask`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:54
msgid "This binding is required for [strict tool routing](tools.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/methods.md:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Message"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Method         | Schema                                                          | Returns                                        |\n"
"| -------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `message.send` | [`message.ts`](../../src/shared/sap-contract/frames/message.ts) | `{ stream_id }`; stream events follow on `evt` |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:62
msgid ""
"Payload: `conversation_id`, `message` (user text). Hub bridges runtime "
"stream to SAP `stream.*` events — see [events.md](events.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/sap/methods.md:63 messages/po4a/en.xml:568
#, no-wrap
msgid "Terminal"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:66
msgid ""
"Hub-side PTY sessions. Events: `terminal.ready`, `terminal.output`, "
"`terminal.exit`, `terminal.error`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:73
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Method            | Schema                                                                                                    |\n"
"| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `terminal.attach` | [`terminal.ts`](../../src/shared/sap-contract/frames/terminal.ts) — optional `cwd`; returns `terminal_id` |\n"
"| `terminal.write`  | `terminal_id`, `data`                                                                                     |\n"
"| `terminal.resize` | `terminal_id`, `cols`, `rows`                                                                             |\n"
"| `terminal.close`  | `terminal_id`                                                                                             |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/methods.md:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tool (Satellite → Hub)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:82
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Method            | Direction       | Role                                          |\n"
"| ----------------- | --------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `tool.register`   | Satellite → Hub | Register local tools; returns canonical names |\n"
"| `tool.unregister` | Satellite → Hub | Remove tools by `local_names`                 |\n"
"| `tool.result`     | Satellite → Hub | Complete a `tool.call`                        |\n"
"| `tool.error`      | Satellite → Hub | Fail a `tool.call`                            |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/methods.md:84
msgid ""
"`tool.call` is an **event**, not RPC — see [tools.md](tools.md) and "
"[events.md](events.md)."
msgstr ""

